eff866490de51be18c .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-56pngy-c35c61cafc56b4eff866490de51be18c hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-47c2pe-65ba5cb84409eeab7207355ffb416733 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-47c2pe-65ba5cb84409eeab7207355ffb416733 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mpnv5ox7-0f86eb42ba0c18851629c8b1387c2d59 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Vom 22. bis 26. Juni 2026<\/strong> werden wir auf der China International Supply Chain Expo (CISCE) in Peking ausstellen.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Dies ist ein wichtiger Meilenstein f\u00fcr uns, erm\u00f6glicht durch die strategische Zusammenarbeit mit der Polnischen Agentur f\u00fcr Investitionen und Handel (PAIH).<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Wo finden Sie uns?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Auf der Messe: Besuchen Sie unseren Stand, sprechen wir \u00fcber Gesch\u00e4ftsm\u00f6glichkeiten und entdecken Sie, woran wir gearbeitet haben.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">In der Stadt: Die ganze Woche \u00fcber reservieren wir Zeit f\u00fcr Gesch\u00e4ftstreffen, Networking und Coffee Chats.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Veranstaltung: 4th CISCE | cisce.org.cn<br \/>\nOrt: China International Exhibition Center (Shunyi Venue), Peking<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Lassen Sie uns ein Treffen vereinbaren!<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kontaktieren Sie uns, um einen Termin zu reservieren.<\/p>\n<p>Wir sehen uns in Peking!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-33qj9e-6868bb23f82d3b809bf621c150d4defe av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mpnv55z5-4900c2f8477384f32932613aac36005f\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mpnv55z5-4900c2f8477384f32932613aac36005f img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mpnv55z5-4900c2f8477384f32932613aac36005f .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mpnv55z5-4900c2f8477384f32932613aac36005f av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5395 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5395 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-1030x1030.jpg\" alt='' title='venol-china-international-exhibition-center'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-1030x1030.jpg 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-80x80.jpg 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/venol-china-international-exhibition-center-2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/venol